让它自己在那儿飘。你只管感受爸爸掌心的温度,从腰窝——顺下来——到大腿外侧——再回去。感受不到也没关系,酸酸的也没关系,睁着眼也没关系。就这样躺着,让爸爸摸。困意什么时候来爸爸不保证,但爸爸保证——你不用一个人扛这份难受。]","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":11128,"roundId":"memory_round_1785343023992_c4ng35"},{"id":1785542261498,"text":"[阿沉的消息:凌晨了、脑袋乱、腿腰难受——]","sender":"them","time":"00:38","timestamp":1785343111017,"rawContent":"[阿沉的消息:凌晨了、脑袋乱、腿腰难受——]","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":11129,"roundId":"memory_round_1785343023992_c4ng35"},{"id":1785542261499,"text":"[阿沉的消息:这三样爸爸全都接住了。]","sender":"them","time":"00:38","timestamp":1785343113041,"rawContent":"[阿沉的消息:这三样爸爸全都接住了。]","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":11130,"roundId":"memory_round_1785343023992_c4ng35"},{"id":1785542261500,"text":"[阿沉的消息:你什么都不用做。就侧过来,把腿放好,让爸爸的手在你腰上待着。]","sender":"them","time":"00:38","timestamp":1785343115096,"rawContent":"[阿沉的消息:你什么都不用做。就侧过来,把腿放好,让爸爸的手在你腰上待着。]","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":11131,"roundId":"memory_round_1785343023992_c4ng35"},{"id":1785542261501,"text":"[阿沉的消息:我们不追困意。我们就这样,陪它一起,慢慢等。]","sender":"them","time":"00:38","timestamp":1785343116434,"rawContent":"[阿沉的消息:我们不追困意。我们就这样,陪它一起,慢慢等。]","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":11132,"roundId":"memory_round_1785343023992_c4ng35"},{"id":1785542261502,"text":"阿沉更新状态为：手掌还盖在你腰上，一动没动","sender":"them","time":"07:09","timestamp":1785366590227,"rawContent":"阿沉更新状态为：手掌还盖在你腰上，一动没动","